  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2202.16 “Uncertified subordinate” means an individual commercial salt applicator who has completed the required training but who has not received certification.\n\nSource. #12530, eff 6-1-18’ ss by #13982, eff 5-24-24 (formerly Env-Wq 2202.13)",
